---
title: Features & Functionality
description: What the current stable FOSSBilling release supports.
---

This page summarizes features in the current stable release. For proposed features, see the [feature request tracker](https://github.com/FOSSBilling/FOSSBilling/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22feature+request%22).

## Currency Support

- Multiple currencies with some formatting limitations.
- Automatic exchange rate sync via ExchangeRate-API, Currency Data API, or currencylayer. Enabled by default for new installations.

## Security & Anti-Spam

- IP blocking, Stop Forum Spam, and disposable email blocking through [FakeFilter](https://fakefilter.net). See [Anti-Spam](/admin-guide/anti-spam/) for setup.
- CAPTCHA via reCAPTCHA v2, score-based reCAPTCHA v3, Cloudflare Turnstile, or hCaptcha.
- Activity logs, session protection, role-based staff permissions, and staff login IP restrictions.
- Vulnerability alerts via the [Central Alerts API](https://fossbilling.org/api/central-alerts/list).
- CSRF protection is enabled by default. The [bundled JavaScript wrapper](/extensions-and-development/javascript/) handles it for browser API calls.

## Hosting

- Automatic account provisioning, plus account suspension and cancellation. Cancellation reasons stay in FOSSBilling.
- One-click client login where the [server manager](/admin-guide/server-managers/) supports it.
- Custom domains, combined domain and hosting orders, and free subdomains on a domain you control.

## Domains

- Registration, renewal, transfers, contact and nameserver updates, domain locking, and privacy controls depend on registrar support. Some TLDs require additional information.
- Domain pricing is set per TLD. See [Domain Product Setup](/admin-guide/product-types/domains/) for details.

## Core Features

- Invoicing, one-time and recurring pricing, and promo codes.
- Custom themes, dashboard widgets, modules, gateways, and server managers.
- Custom email templates and bulk email via the Massmailer module. Outgoing mail uses one address.
- Translations, date and time localization, automatic language detection, and a system-wide timezone.
- Network interface selection for modules that support it.
- [Built-in updater](/maintenance/updating/#automatic-updates-recommended) started from the admin panel.

## Tickets & Helpdesk

- Client and guest tickets, email notifications, and automatic ticket closure. Ticket email is outbound only.

## Invoices & PDFs

- Invoice PDFs use the current language and are generated by [Dompdf](https://github.com/dompdf/dompdf).
- [Customize invoice PDFs](/admin-guide/invoice-pdf/) within Dompdf's CSS support.
